  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie: LSU OCH LYREC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-Study: LSU AND LYREC - LSU+LYREC : Strengthening youth leadership capacity for self-governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LSU har ans&#xf6;kt om Sida-medel f&#xf6;r att finansiera en f&#xf6;rstudie i Demokratiska republiken Kongo (DRK) med syftet att &#xf6;ka sin f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else av situationen i DRK och ungdomsplattformen LYREC, f&#xf6;r att identifiera m&#xf6;jliga hypoteser och ytterligare kontextualisera sina tidigare erfarenheter samt f&#xf6;r att dra slutsatser f&#xf6;r m&#xf6;jliga interventioner att st&#xf6;dja den demokratiska styrningen av ungdomsplattformar och deras engagemang i den demokratiska utvecklingen.

F&#xf6;rstudien f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas ta fem m&#xe5;nader (augusti till december) och den totala budgeten, inklusive programchef, personal och controller samt ett tre veckors l&#xe5;ngt uppdrag i DRK, &#xe4;r 140 100 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LSU has applied to Sida for funding a pre-study in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) with the purpose of increasing their understanding of the DRC landscape and the youth platform LYREC, to identify possible hypothesis and further contextualize their previous experiences and finally to draw conclusions for possible interventions to support the democratic governance of youth platforms and  their engagement in the democratic development. 

The pre-study is expected to take five months (August to December) and the total budget, including programme manager, staff and controller a three weeks long mission in DRC, is 140 100 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
